Installed here: C (gcc), Python, Perl, Go, Rust (rustc, cargo),
JavaScript (node, npm), Ruby, Lua (lua5.4), Scheme (guile), Common Lisp
(sbcl), Racket, Haskell (ghc) and SQLite (sqlite3).

  go run hello.go
  rustc hello.rs && ./hello
  echo 'print(1+1)' | lua5.4

Packages go into your home, they count toward your quota:

  python3 -m venv ~/venv && ~/venv/bin/pip install requests
  npm install --prefix ~/.local some-tool
  cargo install some-tool        (ends up in ~/.cargo/bin)
  gem install --user-install some-gem

